            },
            {
                "entry_id": "9791b675-d0cb-3357-88b7-ffcb33616017",
                "word": "freebooting",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "19a3d7d1-b96a-3e49-b63a-a75e0ede11a8",
                        "entry_id": "9791b675-d0cb-3357-88b7-ffcb33616017",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To pilage or plunder; piracy"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b2ae76d3-f41e-4d3c-9b37-3c6e7993d67e",
                                "sense_id": "19a3d7d1-b96a-3e49-b63a-a75e0ede11a8",
                                "text": "The Haghar are well known, even in Europe, for their freebooting propensities."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "63e70653-4636-4347-8a17-f25ee9ccfa91",
                                "sense_id": "19a3d7d1-b96a-3e49-b63a-a75e0ede11a8",
                                "text": "Why do you now refuse to protect your own highway into the Interior, […] and thus put an end to the freebooting of the Boers, and of our own people who joined them?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "904ef425-5c21-4884-a724-0e320ac910bf",
                                "sense_id": "19a3d7d1-b96a-3e49-b63a-a75e0ede11a8",
                                "text": "In a short time freebooting assumed all of the routine of a regular business."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "416aa86f-b1b0-34d8-9f46-e9b60a6ae5ee",
                        "entry_id": "9791b675-d0cb-3357-88b7-ffcb33616017",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Software piracy, or stealing or unauthorized rehosting of digital content."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "62abc687-7ccf-4be7-a334-ddc0c4761754",
                                "sense_id": "416aa86f-b1b0-34d8-9f46-e9b60a6ae5ee",
                                "text": "Your recent issue about the problems of electronic software piracy or \"freebooting\" — if you will — was excellent and timely. However, I wonder if both sides have failed to understand the social significance of the struggle."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fc070100-96a0-4744-8f0a-20e593236c93",
                                "sense_id": "416aa86f-b1b0-34d8-9f46-e9b60a6ae5ee",
                                "text": "Freebooting of broadcast satellite signals may exist privately, but we have no evidence of illegal signal capture being commercialized any longer."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e09899f8-fd6c-4836-be0b-05b11d62fa76",
                                "sense_id": "416aa86f-b1b0-34d8-9f46-e9b60a6ae5ee",
                                "text": "Many felt that the software companies are really the ones who ought to be called pirates. […] No wonder, the reader said, that customers are tempted to a little freebooting of their own."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3ac49f2c-dd2f-488d-be03-505a192fd500",
                                "sense_id": "416aa86f-b1b0-34d8-9f46-e9b60a6ae5ee",
                                "text": "Oh those freebooters taking our videos! I'm sick of it. Freebooting, you know, it's a serious issue!"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
